
### Root `.dockerignore`:
```
# Exclude frontend from API builds
frontend/node_modules
frontend/.next
frontend/dist
frontend/build

# Exclude Python cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.so

# Exclude common patterns
.git
.gitignore
.env
.venv
venv/
*.log
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea

# But keep backend and necessary files
!backend/
```

### Also create `frontend/.dockerignore`:
```
node_modules
.next
.git
.gitignore
README.md
.env*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
*.pem
coverage
.vscode
.idea
